OL,3,GNEWSAVandalism puts conservation at
OL,4,Arisk, council warns
OL,5,
OL,6,FVandalism is putting a conservation
OL,7,Fsite at risk, a council has warned.
OL,9,FDorset Council said fencing at Stephens
OL,10,FCastle in Verwood, Dorset, was cut in
OL,11,Fmultiple places between 15 and 16
OL,12,FOctober, leaving the entire fence line
OL,13,Fneeding to be replaced.
OL,15,FThe fencing was installed to support
OL,16,Fthe introduction of grazing animals as
OL,17,Fpart of a wider conservation project.
OL,19,FTDorset Police has been informed, and
OL,20,Fadditional patrols will be carried out
OL,21,Fin the area, the council said.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
